{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>When He hears your complaints against YHWH — and what are we?</b> He mentioned the glory of YHWH, which is the attribute of justice, as in what is written (Exodus 24:17): ״ומראה כבוד ה' כאש אוכלת״ — 'and the appearance of the glory of YHWH was like a devouring fire.' Therefore the Name is hinted here inverted, and it is an allusion to the attribute of justice in every place."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:59:59.108347036Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}